# LICENSE — @dzhechkov/cloudru-hub

This file has two parts because the shipped work has two provenances. Part 1 covers every
byte actually contained in this npm package. Part 2 records the licensing status of the
Hermes engine additions, which this package deliberately does NOT contain.

