## Part 2 — The Hermes engine additions (the ~144-tool MCP layer) — NOT in this package

This package contains ZERO bytes of the Hermes engine additions: no engine binary, no
engine Go sources, no engine skill corpus. The engine binary is located at RUNTIME
(environment variable / config path / a future platform package) and is never bundled
here. See ADR-002 (distribution form) and the package README.

Redistribution status of the engine additions (the Hermes author's contribution on top
of the owner's CLI foundation):

GRANT RECORDED (ADR-001 AM-2, exit 2 — 2026-08-12): Тимур, the author of the Hermes
engine additions (the ~144-tool MCP layer built on the owner's original Go CLI
foundation), approved publication of this package, as reported by the repository owner
(Dmitry Zhechkov) on 2026-08-12. The approval is owner-attested; archiving the author's
written confirmation is a recorded owner follow-up (see the grant record linked below).
Per the owner's standing attribution condition, publication carries authorship credit:
the Hermes engine additions are the work of Тимур; the original Go CLI foundation and
every byte contained in this package are the work of Dmitry Zhechkov (Part 1).

The author did not designate a licence text for the engine additions themselves.
Accordingly: this package continues to ship ZERO bytes of the engine additions, the MIT
licence in Part 1 covers ONLY the owner's code, and nothing in this file grants any
third party rights to the engine additions — their use remains governed by their
author's own terms.

Grant-Confirmation: https://github.com/djd1m/dz-harness-hub/blob/main/features/hermes-claude-adaptation/03_adr/grant-record-2026-08-12.md
